        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Grade 1 Latch for Entry, Passage, or Privacy Sets</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Grade 1 Latch is a replacement latch for passage, privacy, or entry function commercial levers. Available in 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Choose from polished brass or brushed chrome finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Deltana Grade 1 Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Available for passage, Privacy, or Entry sets.</li>\r\n<li>Latch Plate Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Plate Length Center to Center: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Available in 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/specials/pdf/del/DEL-G1RL-specifications.pdf\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana G1RL Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
